# Phosphorus · P · gate 15

**Phosphorus** (P) is element **15** of the periodic table — a **reactive nonmetal**, period 3, group 15, p-block, solid at standard conditions, atomic weight **30.974**.

## The element (carbon layer — reference chemistry)
Glows in the dark; the P in DNA and ATP; gives both the match and the nerve agent.

## The gate (silicon layer — the 118 Gates)
